      "description": "SPECIFICATIONS\nPRINT\n• Maximum Printing Resolution: 4800 x 600 dpi\n• Number of Ink Cartridges: 2\n• Print Speed\n     • B&W: approx. 8.0 ipm\n     • Colour: approx. 4.0 ipm\n• Standard Paper Input (Front Cassette / Tray): A4 / A5 / B5 / Letter = 60 / Legal = 10 (Rear Tray)\n\nSCAN\n• Scanner Type / Scanning Method: Flatbed / CIS (Contact Image Sensor)\n• Letter Only 8.5\" (inches) x 11\" (inches)\nCOPY\n• Letter Only 8.5\" (inches) x 11\" (inches)\n\n• Dimensions \n(W x D x H): approx. 426 x 306 x 145 mm\n• Weight: approx. \n3.5 kg Box \n\nInclusion:\n1 x Canon Pixma MG2570S Colour All-In-One Inkjet Printer\n1 x Canon Original PG-745 Black Ink Cartridge (Starter Ink)\n1 x Canon Original CL-746 Color Ink Cartridge\n(Starter Ink)\n1 x USB Cable\n1 x Power Cable\n1 x User Guide\n1 x CD Installer Driver\nONE YEAR WARRANTY, SERVICE CENTER OF CANON\nPlease note that you can only use original ink cartridge (do not refill the cartridge) and do not convert it to CISS so that warranty will not be voided.\n*No assistance will be entertained once warranty is voided*\n\n*This is not Converted to CISS. But this is Complete Package with Black and Colored Ink Cartridge Sealed.\n\nThis is not wireless, this is wired connection ( pc/laptop to printer).",
